Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.28,0:00:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But your picture isn't true. Your father was the weak one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He was sick. She could make him do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She got aroused watching him punish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Hello? Is nobody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he didn't want to answer with the demons' claws in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What can a poor priest do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it'll take greater powers before he's normal again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over. Now.
